<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Agip half-yr profits higher.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Agip half-yr profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian Agip half-year result to end-June. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				    1996	  1995</p>
<p>Turnover			 2,900   vs  2,600</p>
<p>Profit before taxation	 140.4 vs    115</p>
<p>Taxation			    42.5 vs     40.2</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	   97.9 vs     74.8</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
